# LaunchLayer standing "don't touch" list

Applies to every session on this project.

- No framework/hosting/CMS switch without a written plan and owner approval.
- No heavy animation, parallax, auto-playing video, or gamified cursor effects.
- No purple/indigo gradients, glassmorphism, or dark-mode-by-default.
- No URL changes or deletion of location/SEO pages.
- No cookies/analytics/tracking added without a compliant consent banner + telling the owner.
- No text over busy images without a solid contrast overlay.
- Never remove the phone number or the no-fix-no-fee / free-collection messaging.

## Working style

- Work in small, reversible steps.
- Before changing anything, explain in plain English what will change and which files.
- Do not change site content, prices, phone numbers, or page URLs unless explicitly asked.
- Do not delete pages.
- Keep the existing plain-English tone.
- After each change, give a one-line summary and exact browser check steps.
- If something is risky or might break existing pages, stop and ask first.
